Fix "syntax error, unexpected token readonly" on PHP 8.1.

Readonly classes ("readonly class Foo") are a PHP 8.2 feature. On PHP 8.1
these declarations are a parse error. Drop the class-level readonly modifier
so the module parses on PHP 8.1; the classes are stateless service/hook
objects, so losing the immutability enforcement has no functional effect.

See https://www.drupal.org/project/filefield_paths/issues/3622262

